      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“天皇赏（秋）”。名将怒涛要与好歌剧\n展开秋季对决。而她的目标是──",
      "source_fingerprint": "dfd9f10f78e35cb9d4a782ea32f6dc5fe3b3467672bb5c2413906db4600310ee",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
